## Model List

### User Model

Stores information about system users such as Admin and Pharmacy Owners.

| Attribute | Description                      |
| --------- | -------------------------------- |
| userId    | Unique user ID                   |
| username  | Username for login               |
| password  | User password                    |
| role      | User role (Admin/Pharmacy Owner) |
| email     | User email address               |

### Pharmacy Model

Stores pharmacy details.

| Attribute     | Description         |
| ------------- | ------------------- |
| pharmacyId    | Unique pharmacy ID  |
| pharmacyName  | Pharmacy name       |
| address       | Pharmacy location   |
| contactNumber | Contact number      |
| ownerName     | Pharmacy owner name |

### Medicine Model

Stores medicine information.

| Attribute    | Description        |
| ------------ | ------------------ |
| medicineId   | Unique medicine ID |
| medicineName | Medicine name      |
| manufacturer | Manufacturer name  |
| price        | Medicine price     |
| expiryDate   | Expiry date        |

### Stock Model

Maintains medicine stock availability in pharmacies.

| Attribute          | Description              |
| ------------------ | ------------------------ |
| stockId            | Unique stock ID          |
| pharmacyId         | Pharmacy reference ID    |
| medicineId         | Medicine reference ID    |
| quantity           | Available quantity       |
| availabilityStatus | Available / Out of Stock |

### SearchHistory Model (Optional)

Stores user search records.

| Attribute    | Description             |
| ------------ | ----------------------- |
| searchId     | Unique search ID        |
| userId       | User reference ID       |
| medicineName | Searched medicine name  |
| searchDate   | Date and time of search |

## Model Relationships

* One Pharmacy can have multiple Medicines.
* One Medicine can be available in multiple Pharmacies.
* Stock acts as a bridge between Pharmacy and Medicine.
* Users can search for medicines and view availability details.
